msgstr "Semua data di {model} ({path}) akan dihapus."

#: installer.rs:1002
msgid "_Erase and Install"
msgstr "_Hapus dan pasang"

#: installer.rs:1003
msgid "The chosen partitions will be formatted. Other partitions are not changed."
msgstr "Partisi yang dipilih akan diformat. Partisi lain tidak berubah."

#: installer.rs:1003
msgid "_Format and Install"
msgstr "_Format dan pasang"

#: installer.rs:1004
msgid "The current system is replaced. Your files in /home are kept, and the old system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Sistem saat ini diganti. Berkas Anda di /home dipertahankan, dan sistem lama disimpan sebagai snapshot."

#: installer.rs:1004
msgid "_Reinstall"
msgstr "Pasang _ulang"

#: installer.rs:1005
msgid "MAN is installed into the free space. Windows and its files are not changed."
msgstr "MAN dipasang di ruang kosong. Windows dan berkasnya tidak berubah."

#: installer.rs:1005
msgid "_Install"
msgstr "_Pasang"

#: installer.rs:1019
msgid "Ready to Install"
msgstr "Siap dipasang"

#: installer.rs:1029
msgid "Erase {model}?"
msgstr "Hapus {model}?"

#: installer.rs:1030
msgid "Every file and partition on {path} ({size}) will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Semua berkas dan partisi di {path} ({size}) akan dihapus permanen. Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan."

#: installer.rs:1031
msgid "Erase and Install"
msgstr "Hapus dan pasang"

#: installer.rs:1035
msgid "Format the Chosen Partitions?"
msgstr "Format partisi yang dipilih?"

#: installer.rs:1036
msgid "All data on the chosen partitions will be permanently deleted. Other partitions are not changed."
msgstr "Semua data di partisi yang dipilih akan dihapus permanen. Partisi lain tidak berubah."

#: installer.rs:1037
msgid "Format and Install"
msgstr "Format dan pasang"

#: installer.rs:1041
msgid "Install MAN Alongside Windows?"
msgstr "Pasang MAN berdampingan dengan Windows?"

#: installer.rs:1042
msgid "MAN goes into the {free} of free space on {model} ({path}). Windows and its files are not changed."
msgstr "MAN dipasang di {free} ruang kosong pada {model} ({path}). Windows dan berkasnya tidak berubah."

#: installer.rs:1046
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Pasang"

#: installer.rs:1050
msgid "Reinstall MAN?"
msgstr "Pasang ulang MAN?"

#: installer.rs:1051
msgid "The installed system will be replaced by a fresh copy. Personal files in /home are kept and the old system remains available as a snapshot."
msgstr "Sistem terpasang akan diganti dengan salinan baru. Berkas pribadi di /home dipertahankan dan sistem lama tetap tersedia sebagai snapshot."

#: installer.rs:1052
msgid "Reinstall"
msgstr "Pasang ulang"

